Clones the target creature for up to [6, 8, 9, 10, 12 (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] turns.  The duration of the effect will be divided by half the target's rank, and the target will have have [51%, 54%, 57%, 60%, 62% (TL1-5; SP 100; PARADOX 300)] of its normal life and deal [48%, 45%, 42%, 39%, 37% (TL1-5; SP 100; PARADOX 300)] less damage.

If you clone a hostile creature the clone will target the creature it was cloned from.

The life and damage penalties will be lessened by your Spellpower.
